proton-autogen (3.2.8) noble; urgency=medium

  * Thanks to all users and contributors for their continued support, feedback and bug reports.
  * Add a new shortcut creation feature, allowing users to easily create application shortcuts on the desktop and in the system application menu.
  * Improve application accessibility by integrating installed applications directly into the desktop environment.
  * Improve the graphical user experience with simplified shortcut management.
  * Add support for custom environment variables on a per-application basis, allowing users to define and manage application-specific runtime environment settings directly from the graphical editor.
  * Add configurable FPS limits for MangoHud on a per-application basis.
  * Improve application configuration management by correctly persisting, updating and removing custom environment variables.
  * Improve the graphical application editor with dedicated controls for custom environment variables and MangoHud FPS limits.
  * Improve environment configuration handling to ensure removed custom variables are properly deleted from application profiles.
  * Improve MangoHud configuration flexibility with customizable FPS limits instead of relying solely on the default limit.
  * General UX improvements, configuration handling improvements and code cleanup.

